  "title": "Timing alternative comparison",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Timing alternative comparison</h2><p>Compare two legally available deduction dates under the stated simplified assumptions.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m3-tbs3-f1\">Current-year tax saving</label><input id=\"tcp-m3-tbs3-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m3-tbs3-f2\">Next-year tax saving</label><input id=\"tcp-m3-tbs3-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m3-tbs3-f3\">Additional nominal tax saving from acceleration</label><input id=\"tcp-m3-tbs3-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m3-tbs3-f4\">Net benefit after the stated incremental business cost</label><input id=\"tcp-m3-tbs3-f4\" type=\"text\"></div></section>",
